珠心事迥异，一个想同某个男人建立长久关系，一个一边与多个男人斡旋，一边秘密锁定其中最有闲有钱的一位，想其将来帮她赎身，另一个心地仁厚，却又看破红尘，觉得人生不过如此。几个女人用生存、竞争与心计作武器参与两性（同性）斗争，来到妓院狎妓的男人则抛出金钱、权力与性，见招拆招。相比外面的世界，这里的男女更加原始更加赤裸，然而，赤裸与原始也可理解为透明——正是此种透明，使得他们的关系相比普通男女，更加天真、自由与鲜活。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEuH3JxUaDz9BrTvLTceQAJuLeW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Anxhh4DeakufTyCdjpuVGF08Gpq.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":45935,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oxuhSAROwD87qj0ileaqknUWOHV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oxuhSAROwD87qj0ileaqknUWOHV.jpg","language":"en","width":703,"height":1054},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tcp1cix8CNbRhlx0zbGGYx04x5l.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tcp1cix8CNbRhlx0zbGGYx04x5l.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dSn47K5A6EFhraftlZgAiQgA7ES.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dSn47K5A6EFhraftlZgAiQgA7ES.jpg","language":"en","width":1120,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4sPV6iCxsbpXZbRXJvawgnSCYZf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4sPV6iCxsbpXZbRXJvawgnSCYZf.jpg","language":"en","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https